1
00:00:00,359 --> 00:00:01,589
(Penny:)Anybody want a drink?

2
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:03,263
(Howard:)- Sure.
- Okay.

3
00:00:03,462 --> 00:00:07,162
(Bernadette:)So did you spend last night hearing
about this silly parking-space fight too?

4
00:00:07,366 --> 00:00:10,066
(Amy:)For hours. Fortunately,
I couldn't understand most of it...

5
00:00:10,268 --> 00:00:12,968
...because Sheldon was wearing
that stupid robot mask.

6
00:00:13,972 --> 00:00:17,032
(Bernadette:)Howard was so angry, I had
to mash up Benadryl in his ice cream...

7
00:00:17,242 --> 00:00:19,272
(Bernadette:)...to get him to fall asleep.

8
00:00:20,045 --> 00:00:24,705
(Amy:)I guess this is what we get for being
with two testosterone-fueled alpha males.

9
00:00:25,984 --> 00:00:27,954
(Amy:)At some point,
they're bound to lock horns.

10
00:00:28,186 --> 00:00:31,586
(Penny:)I'm assuming these are some kind
of horns they bought at Comic-Con?

11
00:00:33,959 --> 00:00:36,429
(Bernadette:)I'm really sorry
they took Sheldon's spot away.

12
00:00:36,628 --> 00:00:39,618
(Bernadette:)He shouldn't have to suffer
just because Howard's a big deal now.

13
00:00:39,831 --> 00:00:43,561
(Amy:)I know. Sheldon should just let Howard
have his little moment in the sun.

14
00:00:44,236 --> 00:00:45,606
(Bernadette:)What's that supposed to mean?

15
00:00:46,071 --> 00:00:48,561
(Amy:)Well, I mean,
Howard's never gonna go to space again...

16
00:00:48,774 --> 00:00:51,574
(Amy:)...but Sheldon will always be a genius.

17
00:00:53,145 --> 00:00:56,805
(Bernadette:)You're right. And I'm sure Sheldon
will get a fancy parking spot again...

18
00:00:57,015 --> 00:01:02,025
(Bernadette:)...if and when he makes
a worthwhile contribution to science.

